    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Purpose with the infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "**En vue de**, **dans le but de** and **dans l'intention de** + infinitive express a goal: **Je travaille en vue de réussir** (I work with a view to passing). They are formal."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Fear with the subjunctive",
     "texto": [
      "**De peur que** and **de crainte que** (for fear that) take the subjunctive: **Je prends un manteau de peur que tu aies froid** (I'm taking a coat for fear that you are cold)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
